  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmiraculixx%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"dono-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/625146681182f85ef448f5c910e4cd28ec6cf604.png\" alt=\"veinminer-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-hotkey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9badc43c5a3708f90d24088df4f37c03acc943b8.png\" alt=\"client-badge\"></a></p>\n<h2>⛏️ 脉矿附魔</h2>\n<p>这是一个针对流行模组/插件/数据包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Veinminer</a> 的附加组件，它将脉矿（Veinmining）功能限制为一种新的自定义附魔 <code>Veinmine</code>！只要安装了此附加组件，脉矿功能就只能通过该附魔来实现（同时仍会尊重方块规则和设置）。</p>\n<p>所有版本均兼容 <strong>Paper</strong>/<strong>Folia</strong>！<br>\n<strong>DataPack</strong> 版本请见 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fveinminer-enchantment%252fversions%253fl%253ddatapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此处</strong></a></p>\n<h2>⚠ 重要提示</h2>\n<p>为了让此附加组件正常工作，您必须也安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Veinminer</strong></a>！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1228e4a9540a344e54ac41e6b33a9bb1a63ea33b.png\" alt=\"Veinmine Enchant on Pickaxe\"></p>\n<h2>⚙ 设置</h2>\n<p><strong>Fabric/Quilt/NeoForge</strong>：打开 jar 文件（使用 WinRAR、7-Zip 等），并导航至 <code>data/veinminer-enchantment/enchantment/veinminer.json</code><br>\n<strong>Paper/Folia</strong>：导航至 <code>plugins/veinminer/enchantmentSettings.json</code></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ID</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>weight</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>附魔出现的频率（数值越高 -> 越常见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_cost</code></td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>附魔在附魔表中出现的最低等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_cost</code></td>\n<td>65</td>\n<td>附魔在附魔表中停止出现的最高等级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>anvil_cost</code></td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>在铁砧中合并附魔所需的经验等级成本（可叠加）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>附魔名称由一个可翻译键 <code>enchantment.veinminer-enchantment.veinminer</code> 定义，默认值为 <code>Veinmine</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>Affordable</strong> 服务器？在这个时代居然还有？点击下方 <strong>支持我</strong>，为您节省 <strong>10%</strong> 的费用 + 额外赠送 <strong>2天免费</strong> 体验 ♥️ \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvoltra.gg%252fr%252fmiraculixx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d594c32a9208540624e534d88ff2e428fed4c6d2.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br>\n  #广告 - 您的支持有助于让本项目得以延续 :)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>",
